@startuml demo
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title ComputeHelper: 4-Bit GPU 基数排序 (Radix Sort) 时序图

actor "主控类\n(FluidSolver)" as CPU_Main
participant "ComputeHelper\n(工具类)" as Helper
control "Compute Shader\n(算子内核)" as GPU_Kernels
database "VRAM 显存\n(ComputeBuffers)" as VRAM

== 准备阶段 ==
CPU_Main -> Helper : 调用 Sort(keysBuffer, valuesBuffer)
activate Helper

Helper -> VRAM : 验证 Buffer 长度并分配临时缓存 (TempBuffers)
activate VRAM
VRAM --> Helper : 显存就绪
deactivate VRAM

== 排序循环 (基于 4-bit, 32位数据共需迭代 8 次) ==
loop 迭代 8 次 (bitShift 从 0 到 28)
    
    note right of Helper: 1. 频率统计 (Histogram)
    Helper -> GPU_Kernels : Dispatch(Kernel_Count)
    activate GPU_Kernels
    GPU_Kernels -> VRAM : 读取 Keys，统计各桶数量
    GPU_Kernels --> Helper : 统计完成
    deactivate GPU_Kernels
    
    note right of Helper: 2. 前缀和计算 (Prefix Sum / Scan)
    Helper -> GPU_Kernels : Dispatch(Kernel_Scan)
    activate GPU_Kernels
    GPU_Kernels -> VRAM : 在显存内对直方图执行并行前缀和
    GPU_Kernels --> Helper : 计算完成
    deactivate GPU_Kernels
    
    note right of Helper: 3. 数据重排 (Scatter)
    Helper -> GPU_Kernels : Dispatch(Kernel_Scatter)
    activate GPU_Kernels
    GPU_Kernels -> VRAM : 根据前缀和索引，将数据写入目标 Buffer
    GPU_Kernels --> Helper : 重排完成
    deactivate GPU_Kernels
    
    Helper -> Helper : 交换读写 Buffer 指针 (Ping-Pong 缓冲)
end

== 结束阶段 ==
Helper --> CPU_Main : 排序流程结束，控制权交回
deactivate Helper

@enduml